When changing Fly-Fix visuals or interaction chrome, follow `.cursor/skills/flyfix-ui-ux/SKILL.md`.

Quick constraints:
- Light-first palette (coral `theme.buttonBg`, navy `theme.primary`, navy/paper `theme.price`, cloud paper neutrals)
- Type: Manrope (display) + Inter (body) — not Outfit/Sora/Figtree startup stacks
- No neon teal SaaS look, purple gradients, cream/terracotta AI cluster, glow shadows, pill forests
- Sort = segmented control; destination mood photos via `destinationMood.ts`
- Prefer theme tokens over hardcoded accent hex
